## TIER P5: TELEMETRY, LOGGING & CONTINUOUS UPTIME

- **Screen-Based Requirement Change Log:** Record all chat-requested modifications in `requirement/{screen}.txt` with ISO timestamp, modified files, and test status.
- **Continuous Uptime Guard:** Validate server process health (HTTP 200) after any change. Zero hard-refresh failures.
